      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شازرهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَازَرَةٌ</span>, <i>He treated him,</i> or
<i>regarded him, with enmity,</i> or <i>hostility:</i> whence
[the manner of looking termed] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّزْرُ</span>. (AA.)

